connu pour la qualité de ses prises en charge personnalisées, notamment au travers de ses unités Alzheimer.\n3. ContactPour toute information complémentaire, veuillez contacter Acumen Patrimoine :\nTéléphone : 01 41 55 12 20\nEmail : info@acumenpatrimoine.fr","addr":"323 Chemin de la Seignière","gal":["https://dj32ymiemc11o.cloudfront.net/eyJidWNrZXQiOiJvdGFyZWUtcHJvZHVjdGlvbi1maWxlcyIsImtleSI6IjY4ODAwMjk5ZjAwNDI1ZmY2Y2VkZTE5ZTVkZjgyZDNmZTBiODZlNGEiLCJlZGl0cyI6eyJyZXNpemUiOnsid2lkdGgiOjkwMCwiaGVpZ2h0Ijo5MDAsImZpdCI6Imluc2lkZSJ9fSwiZmlsZUhhc2giOiIwYTNlMmRmYzI1NDM3ZjYwY2M1YmFmOGMzNGJlYmE5ZiJ9?signature=174fae2aab1542c99886b89143ab126c6aa3ef56cb3a0d1e6bccc4bbc2ecd031","https://dj32ymiemc11o.cloudfront.net/eyJidWNrZXQiOiJvdGFyZWUtcHJvZHVjdGlvbi1maWxlcyIsImtleSI6IjBlODNiMDJhMDBjMzA4NTkyYTI3NzAyYzkzMjhlNDI3MmNiYzlhY2QiLCJlZGl0cyI6eyJyZXNpemUiOnsid2lkdGgiOjkwMCwiaGVpZ2h0Ijo5MDAsImZpdCI6Imluc2lkZSJ9fSwiZmlsZUhhc2giOiJhNTZlM2NlMjViOGY0NTg3MTQ4NDllNGI4MTM2YzM1YiJ9?signature=cfcc5d5044659c80bb7642389a3b18e09463e1da7b692b8741b169a85996f936","https://dj32ymiemc11o.cloudfront.net/eyJidWNrZXQiOiJvdGFyZWUtcHJvZHVjdGlvbi1maWxlcyIsImtleSI6IjZmNDdmMTc2NDZmMDIwNmI1MjVlZjhjYzllNDcwN2E4OWE5YTg4NzAiLCJlZGl0cyI6eyJyZXNpemUiOnsid2lkdGgiOjkwMCwiaGVpZ2h0Ijo5MDAsImZpdCI6Imluc2lkZSJ9fSwiZmlsZUhhc2giOiJiYjA2MDc2MTMyOTBhMTBlOWQ2OGZjN2Y2YmZhNTU1OSJ9?signature=c210dab3315f32230a456b93ed4846ffea30765b3d1f88410a32082e0bad13cb","https://dj32ymiemc11o.cloudfront.net/eyJidWNrZXQiOiJvdGFyZWUtcHJvZHVjdGlvbi1maWxlcyIsImtleSI6ImI4MjE0ZTEyNjZiMmM2ZDAxZjMwMDgyZjljNjhjZmFiMDVkYTcyYjciLCJlZGl0cyI6eyJyZXNpemUiOnsid2lkdGgiOjkwMCwiaGVpZ2h0Ijo5MDAsImZpdCI6Imluc2lkZSJ9fSwiZmlsZUhhc2giOiI0MWQ2ZjY3YWRjMmVmZGYyMDU5ZTkyOTFkNjM0YWE5ZiJ9?signature=dac443adaa9542d37831e8b1ed7d077be2c991db7cb6ae370361264f88ccc853","https://dj32ymiemc11o.cloudfront.net/eyJidWNrZXQiOiJvdGFyZWUtcHJvZHVjdGlvbi1maWxlcyIsImtleSI6Ijk4MzcwZjVlNGVlZjM0MGQ0YTBkMjhmNmViMzBlM2Y3MTk1YTQ4NGYiLCJlZGl0cyI6eyJyZXNpemUiOnsid2lkdGgiOjkwMCwiaGVpZ2h0Ijo5MDAsImZ